{"team":"DET","col":"#4FA8E8","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":63.3,"adot":6.5,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Balanced Attack</h2><p>They're a heavy under-center team (48% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>In the passing game the ball funnels to <strong>Amon-Ra St. Brown</strong> \u2014 <strong>29% of targets</strong> (league ~23%), a genuine alpha share that concentrates the receiving value at the top.</p><p>Their backs are a real part of the passing game \u2014 RBs see <strong>22%</strong> of targets (vs ~18%), which props up <strong>Jahmyr Gibbs</strong>'s reception floor.</p><p>It's a short, rhythm-based passing game \u2014 aDOT just <strong>6.5</strong> \u2014 that lives on YAC and checkdowns, boosting reception totals over big-play yardage.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 59% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>By the numbers it's an efficient unit \u2014 a 48% success rate (above the 44% average).</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Inside the 20 they lean run-heavy, passing <strong>50%</strong> of the time, funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Jahmyr Gibbs</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 A Balanced Defense</h2><p><strong>Soft against opposing WR2s</strong> \u2014 45 rec yds/game (vs ~36). A rec-yards target.</p><p>They give up deep shots (24% of throws travel 15+ vs ~19%) \u2014 big-play WR upside against them.</p><p>They surrender <strong>109 rushing</strong> and <strong>249 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.63/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>TE touchdowns</strong> (0.29/game vs ~0.24) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing TE anytime-TD</strong> is a repeatable angle.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Jared Goff","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":4,"props":{"Comp":22.48,"Att":33.17,"Pass Yds":254.29,"Pass TD":1.7,"INT":0.51,"Rush Yds":5.63}},{"name":"Joshua Dobbs","slot":"QB2","starter":false,"td":23,"props":{"Comp":2.12,"Att":3.4,"Pass Yds":20.6,"Pass TD":0.12,"INT":0.19,"Rush Yds":11.91}}],"RB":[{"name":"Jahmyr Gibbs","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":57,"props":{"Rush Att":13.69,"Rush Yds":73.1,"Tgt":4.93,"Rec":3.9,"Rec Yds":30.97}},{"name":"Isiah Pacheco","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Rush Att":9.34,"Rush Yds":40.7,"Tgt":2.49,"Rec":2.07,"Rec Yds":13.4}},{"name":"Sione Vaki","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Rush Att":1.86,"Rush Yds":7.23,"Tgt":1.2,"Rec":0.83,"Rec Yds":6.45}},{"name":"Jacob Saylors","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Rush Att":2.02,"Rush Yds":8.58,"Tgt":1.14,"Rec":0.76,"Rec Yds":5.58}}],"WR":[{"name":"Amon-Ra St. Brown","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":41,"props":{"Tgt":8.35,"Rec":6.17,"Rec Yds":71.01,"Rec TD":0.52}},{"name":"Jameson Williams","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":33,"props":{"Tgt":6.57,"Rec":4.06,"Rec Yds":64.04,"Rec TD":0.41}},{"name":"Isaac TeSlaa","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":27,"props":{"Tgt":3.3,"Rec":2.06,"Rec Yds":28.64,"Rec TD":0.32}},{"name":"Tay Martin","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":1.88,"Rec":1.07,"Rec Yds":15.21,"Rec TD":0.11}}],"TE":[{"name":"Sam LaPorta","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":31,"props":{"Tgt":5.11,"Rec":3.84,"Rec Yds":41.69,"Rec TD":0.37}},{"name":"Brock Wright","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":26,"props":{"Tgt":3.3,"Rec":2.12,"Rec Yds":20.31,"Rec TD":0.3}},{"name":"Tyler Conklin","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":6,"props":{"Tgt":2.04,"Rec":1.25,"Rec Yds":11.98,"